    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-2.5.01-13",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Windhoek illustrates integrated management rather than dependence on a single source. City information describes the contribution of the Omatako, Swakoppoort and Von Bach dam system, groundwater and reclaimed water. Supply and demand measures respond to changing conditions. These named components explain diversification; they do not provide a current source percentage or restriction category without a dated operational record.",
      "claim_ids": [
        "CL-6137-2.5.01-1",
        "CL-6137-2.5.01-2",
