    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-2.5.01-18",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Fair access also requires information about who receives the service. A settlement's total supply can rise while some households remain disconnected or face long collection journeys. An industrial allocation can be economically useful while requiring protection of essential domestic needs. Describe the distribution as well as the aggregate. This allows a judgement to recognise production benefits without treating every cubic metre as equally accessible to every user.",
      "claim_ids": [
        "CL-6137-2.5.01-1",
        "CL-6137-2.5.01-2",
        "CL-6137-2.5.01-01-1",
        "CL-6137-2.5.01-01-2",
